# NV-05 — Quan ly quy trinh

UC: 41-51  
Actors: system administrator, coordinator, leader  
Status: specified; dossier transitions mocked; configurable workflow pending.

## Scope

Draft/copy/delete workflow, steps, transition conditions, roles, SLA, notifications, versioning, activation and runtime workflow management.

## Acceptance criteria

- Only one active version is used for new dossiers; in-flight dossiers retain their version.
- A transition validates actor permission, current state, required data and SLA policy.
- Workflow changes are versioned and auditable, never silently rewrite history.
- Notification rules are evaluated per transition.

## Test mapping

`workflow.service.spec.ts`, `mock-db.service.spec.ts` (planned extension).

